%% UC-25 — Manage knowledge base (document upload + ingestion) — admin only
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (kbRouter)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant LR as LightRAG
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    A->>AP: Upload PDF / TXT / MD
    AP->>B: POST /api/v1/kb (multipart)
    B->>B: requireRole(admin)
    B->>AI: POST /api/v1/kb (proxy, service token)
    AI->>LR: POST /documents/file (multipart)
    LR-->>AI: accepted - processing in background
    AI-->>B: 201
    B-->>AP: 201 document queued
    Note over LR,LLM: Background: chunk text, LLM entity/relation extraction -> knowledge graph, embed chunks -> vector index
    A->>AP: Check document status / list documents
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/kb
    B->>AI: GET /api/v1/kb -> LightRAG /documents
    AI-->>AP: document list + processing status
